entry: opening

LOCATION Lighthouse
  label: The Lighthouse

LOCATION LampRoom
  label: The Lamp Room

CHARACTER Wren
  faction: Keepers
  trust: 0 to 100 = 20

  on lamp_lit guest
    <set: self.trust += 5>
    -> self.reassure

  beat reassure(guest)
    SELF
      The lamp holds.

== opening
  cast: Wren
  setting: Lighthouse

The stair smells of paraffin and salt.

WREN
  (guarded)
  You're late. The lamp's been dark for hours.
  <if: Wren.trust > 50>
    But I'm glad it's you.
  <else>
    Don't touch anything.

<let: gale = Weather.wind > 40>
<if: gale>
  Wind hunts along the stair.

* Climb to the lamp room.
  <set: Wren.trust += 10>
  <fire: lamp_lit>
  -> lamp_room
* [Wren watches you go.] Leave her to it.
  <sfx: door_close, gain: -6>
  -> END

== lamp_room
  setting: LampRoom

<each visit>
  first
    The lamp room is colder than you expected.
  then
    You've been here before. The glass is still warm.
